### 1. Ambil Semua Produk
GET http://localhost:8080/products

###

### 2. Ambil Produk Berdasarkan ID (ID = 1)
GET http://localhost:8080/products/1

###

### 3. Tambah Produk Baru
POST http://localhost:8080/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ultra HD",
  "price": 400000, 
  "stock": 20,
  "category": "Elektronik"
}

###

### 5. Update Produk (PUT)
PUT http://localhost:8080/products/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Webcam Ultra 4K",
  "price": 750000,
  "stock": 15
}


### 4. Hapus Produk Berdasarkan ID (Hapus ID = 2)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/products/1

###

### 5. Tes Error: ID Tidak Ditemukan
GET http://localhost:8080/products/999

### 6. Cari Produk Berdasarkan Kata Kunci (Search)
GET http://localhost:8080/products/search?keyword=Ultra

###

### 7. Tes Error: Kata Kunci Kosong
GET http://localhost:8080/products/search?keyword=

### 8. Registrasi User Baru
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kevin Pratama",
  "email": "kevin@example.com",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

###

### 9. Tes Error: Registrasi dengan Email Sama (Duplikat)
POST http://localhost:8080/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kevin Kloning",
  "email": "kevin@example.com",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

###

### 10. Login: Password Benar
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kevin@example.com",
  "password": "rahasia123"
}

###

### 11. Login: Password Salah
POST http://localhost:8080/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "kevin@example.com",
  "password": "passwordngawur"
}
